      "h2": "Tribes of the net",
      "body_html": "<p class=\"big\">Modern subcultures form online:</p><ul><li>Gaming clans.</li><li>K-pop <b>fandoms</b>.</li><li>Drift car TikTok.</li><li>Anime fans.</li></ul><p>Anyone, anywhere can join. 🌐</p>"
