    {
      "tag": "Stop 2",
      "h2": "Identity online",
      "body_html": "<p>Your <span class=\"hl p\">digital identity</span> is your photos, posts and choices online.</p><p>It can be polished — and it can be very different from real life.</p><p>Algorithms push you toward what you already like.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Stop 3",
      "h2": "Echo chambers",
      "body_html": "<p><span class=\"hl y\">Echo chambers</span> happen when you only see views you agree with.</p><p>Risk: extreme ideas seem normal.</p><p>Healthy habit: follow people who think differently from you. 🤝</p>"
    }
